│ Keys                                                                         │
│ Chords are typed in sequence (g then l). Digits before a motion repeat it (1…│
│ Rebind in ~/.config/ytm-go/keymap.toml — this page follows your bindings.    │
│                                                                              │
│ Playback                                                                     │
│   space            Play / pause                                              │
│   n                Next track                                                │
│   p                Previous track                                            │
│   .                Play a random track from the queue                        │
│   P                Play the focused list from the start                      │
│   C-r              Cycle repeat (off, all, one)                              │
│   C-s              Toggle shuffle                                            │
│   +                Volume up                                                 │
│   -                Volume down                                               │
│   _                Mute                                                      │
│   >                Seek forward                                              │
│   <                Seek backward                                             │
│   ^                Restart track                                             │
